<title>USA: Atc Group Services Inc year net rises.</title>
<headline>Atc Group Services Inc year net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended February 28 (29)</p>
<p>				1997	  1996     $Change  %Change</p>
<p> TOTAL  REVENUES    113,855,364  44,964,897  68,890,467  153%</p>
<p> NET REVENUES	  95,901,469  40,113,691  55,787,778  139%</p>
<p>INCOME BEFORE</p>
<p>  INCOME TAXES	 10,397,734   5,670,998   4,726,736   83%</p>
<p> NET INCOME	     6,307,734   3,865,998   2,441,736   63%</p>
<p>Fully diluted earnings</p>
<p>  per share (1)		 .74	   .54	   .20   37%</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares</p>
<p>  Outstanding	   8,508,061   7,181,416   1,326,645   18%</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) Fiscal 1996 fully diluted earnings per share includes a one-time tax benefit of $350,000 or $.05 per share from the utilization of Aurora Environmental Inc.'s net operating loss carryforward by ATC as a result of the merger of Aurora into ATC.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
